"{\"activities\":[{\"name\":\"Identify Risk\",\"description\":\"The 'Identify Risk' activity represents the initial phase of the risk management process where a new risk is identified and recorded.\"},{\"name\":\"Assess Impact\",\"description\":\"The 'Assess Impact' activity involves evaluating the potential impact of an identified risk on the organization.\"},{\"name\":\"Evaluate Probability\",\"description\":\"The 'Evaluate Probability' activity assesses the likelihood of an identified risk occurring.\"},{\"name\":\"Prioritize Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Prioritize Risks' activity ranks identified risks based on their impact and probability to determine the order of mitigation efforts.\"},{\"name\":\"Develop Mitigation Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Develop Mitigation Plan' activity creates a plan to address and mitigate an identified risk, including selecting a mitigation strategy and estimating costs.\"},{\"name\":\"Implement Mitigation\",\"description\":\"The 'Implement Mitigation' activity executes the mitigation plan developed for an identified risk.\"},{\"name\":\"Monitor Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Monitor Risks' activity involves ongoing observation and tracking of risks to ensure mitigation efforts are effective.\"},{\"name\":\"Review Risk Assessment\",\"description\":\"The 'Review Risk Assessment' activity re-evaluates the risk assessment to determine if the risk status has changed or if further action is needed.\"},{\"name\":\"Update Risk Register\",\"description\":\"The 'Update Risk Register' activity updates the central risk register with the latest risk status and assessment information.\"},{\"name\":\"Communicate Risks\",\"description\":\"The 'Communicate Risks' activity informs relevant stakeholders about the risk status and any actions taken.\"},{\"name\":\"Approve Mitigation Plan\",\"description\":\"The 'Approve Mitigation Plan' activity represents the formal approval of a developed mitigation plan. This activity is part of the model but has